      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tuma abantu baje bakeete ensi Kanaani, ye ndi kubagha imwe Abaisiraeli. Oidha kutumangaku mulala okuva mu buli kika, nga mukulembeze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Musa yaatuma abakulembeze abo ab'ebika mu Isiraeli, nga bali mu irungu ery'e Parani nga Musengwa Katonda bweyalagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gano n'amaina gaibwe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago n'amaina ag'abantu Musa be yatuma okukeeta ensi Kanaani. Era Musa yakyusa eriina lya Hoshea mutabane wa Nuni, yaamweta Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho musa yaabatuma okukeeta mu nsi Kanaani, ng'abakoba ati: “Muje mubitire mu kiketezo ekikalukalu eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, mungire mu kiketezo eky'ensozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubone ensi eyo nga bw'eri, mubone oba abantu abagirimu ba maani oba banafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubone oba erimu abantu kamaala oba batono, oba nsi nungi oba mbi, oba ebibuga byamu baabizimba na weema oba biriku ebimante ebigumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mubone oba eitaka lyayo igimu oba ikalukalu, era oba kuliku emiti oba kuzira. Era mufube okuleeta ku bibala byayo.” Ebiseera ebyo byali bya mizabbibu ghe gisookereza okwenza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale abantu abo baaja baakeeta ensi eyo okuva ku irungu ery'e Zini okutuuka e Rehobu, agho gh'oingirira mu Hamathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaniinaniina baingira mu kiketezo ekikalukalu eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, baaja baatuuka e Heburoni. Eyo n'eyali ab'ekika kya Ahimani n'ab'ekika kya Sheshai n'ab'ekika kya Talumai, baidhukulu ba Anaki. Heburoni ekyo, n'ekyasooka okuzimbibwa ghaabitagho emyaka musanvu, memale Zoani kyazimbibwa mu Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baatuuka mu kiiko eky'e Eshikoli, baatemayo olusaga olwaliku ekifaaganda eky'emizabbibu kirala kiti, abantu babiri baakitwalira ku muti, ng'owundi agemyeku eruuyi n'owundi eruuyi. Baatwala ni ku bibala eby'emikomamawanga n'eby'emitiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ekifo ekyo baakituuma Ekiiko eky'Ekifaaganda, olw'ekifaaganda eky'emizabbibu Abaisiraeli kye baatemayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bamaze okukeeta ensi Kanaani okumala enaku amakumi ana, abantu abo baira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaja ye Musa ni Aaroni, ni y'Abaisiraeli boonaboona nga beesoloiza e Kadeshi mu irungu ery'e Parani, baabakobera bye baabonayo, era baabooleka ni ku bibala bye baatoolayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakobera Musa bati: “Twatuuka mu nsi ye watutuma okukeeta, twabona nga ngimu era ng'erimu ebirungi kamaala, era bino n'ebibala byamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu baayo ba maani, n'ebibuga byaibwe binene inho era nga baabyezunguluza ebimante ebigumu. Ate ebyo nga bikaali agho, twabonayo baidhukulu ba Anaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twabona nga Abamaleki baba mu kiketezo kyayo ekikalukalu eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, Abahitti n'Abayebusi n'Abamori, baaba mu kiketezo kyayo eky'ensozi, ate Abakanaani baaba ku mbali okw'enhandha, ni ku mbali okw'omwiga Yorudani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Kalebu yaasirisa abantu, agho mu maiso ga Musa, yaakoba ati: “Mukole tusitukiremu tuje tutwale ensi eyo. Kuba tusobolera irala bukalamu okugighangula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu be yaja nabo baakoba bati: “Titusobola naire kuja kulumba bantu bale, kuba ba maani inho okutusinga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baaleetera Abaisiraeli amawulire ag'obulimba agagema ku nsi ye baaja okukeeta, nga bakoba bati: “Ensi ye twaja okukeeta tebaza mere emala kuliisa bantu baamu. Abantu be twabonayo boonaboona baleeyi inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era twabonayo ni baidhukulu ba Anaki abawaigufu, abasimuka mu Nefili. Ife twebona nga tuli ng'oti bwa masisi, era boona tutyo bwe twababonekera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
